!config/settings.yaml.example

# config/settings.yaml contains secrets (ntfy_topic). Explicit deny (defense in
# depth on top of the default whitelist exclusion) — cmd_149.
config/settings.yaml

# Templates
!templates/
!templates/**

# Context README
!context/
!context/README.md

